{"id":"b642ab331635c77d","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-free-variable.md","title":"Free Variable","display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-free-variable","aliases":["88-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","depends_on":["[[88-df-formula]]","[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-atomic-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — Free Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1,\\ldots,t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t_1,\\ldots,t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (variable set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> (atomic formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}_S:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\">\\(\\mathrm{var}_S:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\)</span> (term-variable map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\)</span> (free-variable map)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\mathrm{var}_S(x)=\\{x\\})\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(\\mathrm{var}_S(c)=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\\forall t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{var}_S(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))=\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{var}_S(t_i))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(t_1=t_2)=\\mathrm{var}_S(t_1)\\cup\\mathrm{var}_S(t_2))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))=\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{var}_S(t_i))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(\\neg\\varphi)=\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}_S(\\psi))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\mathrm{var}_S(x)=\\{x\\})\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(\\mathrm{var}_S(c)=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\\forall t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{var}_S(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))=\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{var}_S(t_i))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(t_1=t_2)=\\mathrm{var}_S(t_1)\\cup\\mathrm{var}_S(t_2))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))=\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{var}_S(t_i))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(\\neg\\varphi)=\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}_S(\\psi))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{free}_S(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{var}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_S\\)</span> are uniquely determined by structural\nrecursion on the finite-depth syntax from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"9df3c26c280af75a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S$ (formulas, see [[88-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t_1,\\ldots,t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S$ (terms, see [[./88-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","